+# anonsync_core rev0667
 
 `anonsync_core` is the C++20 working library for AnonSync, a peer-to-peer file synchronization system. The target product is Resilio Sync-style folder replication across authorized devices, with content identity, resumable transfer, crash-safe local state, conflict handling, and authenticated peer/session boundaries.
 
