+1. Add a deterministic fake peer-session harness that consumes `inspect_sync_staged_transfer().missing_chunks`, calls `build_sync_chunk_request_plan`, has a fake peer build `SyncChunkResponseBatchEnvelope` values, accepts peer bytes through `accept_sync_chunk_response_batch_and_plan_next`, and then commits through receipt-gated materialization.
